msgstr "Cookiecategorieën"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:107
msgid "Banner texts"
msgstr "Bannerteksten"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:108
msgid "Scripts"
msgstr "Scripts"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:109
msgid "Blocked embeds"
msgstr "Geblokkeerde embeds"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:161
msgid "Enable"
msgstr "Inschakelen"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:162
msgid "Show the consent banner, gate registered scripts and block embeds."
msgstr "Toon de toestemmingsbanner, scherm geregistreerde scripts af en blokkeer embeds."

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:169
msgid "Banner position"
msgstr "Positie van de banner"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:170
msgid "Bottom (recommended)"
msgstr "Onderaan (aanbevolen)"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:170
msgid "Top"
msgstr "Bovenaan"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:177
msgid "Consent expiry (days)"
msgstr "Geldigheid toestemming (dagen)"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:178
msgid "How long a consent stays valid. After it expires, the banner returns. Max 365."
msgstr "Hoe lang een toestemming geldig blijft. Daarna verschijnt de banner opnieuw. Maximaal 365."

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:185
msgid "Banner version"
msgstr "Bannerversie"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:186
msgid "Increase this number to ask every visitor for consent again, for example after changing the texts or your cookie policy."
msgstr "Verhoog dit getal om elke bezoeker opnieuw om toestemming te vragen, bijvoorbeeld na het aanpassen van de teksten of je cookiebeleid."

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:193
msgid "Privacy page"
msgstr "Privacypagina"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:201
msgid "Footer link"
msgstr "Footerlink"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:202
msgid "Automatically add a “Cookie settings” button to the footer, so consent can always be withdrawn."
msgstr "Voeg automatisch een knop “Cookie-instellingen” toe aan de footer, zodat toestemming altijd kan worden ingetrokken."

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:209
msgid "Cache-safe mode"
msgstr "Cacheveilige modus"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:210
msgid "For sites with a full-page cache that ignores cookies. Embeds are always rendered as placeholders and upgraded in the browser, so cached pages can never show embeds to visitors who did not consent."
msgstr "Voor sites met een full-page cache die cookies negeert. Embeds worden altijd als placeholder weergegeven en pas in de browser geladen, zodat gecachte pagina's nooit embeds tonen aan bezoekers die geen toestemming gaven."

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:223
msgid "Background"
msgstr "Achtergrond"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:224
msgid "Text"
msgstr "Tekst"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:225
msgid "Border"
msgstr "Rand"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:226
#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:266
msgid "Buttons (primary)"
msgstr "Knoppen (primair)"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:227
msgid "Button text (primary)"
msgstr "Knoptekst (primair)"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:242
msgid "Border radius"
msgstr "Afronding hoeken"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:243
msgid "For example 6px, 0.5rem or 0. Empty uses the default (6px)."
msgstr "Bijvoorbeeld 6px, 0.5rem of 0. Leeg gebruikt de standaardwaarde (6px)."

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:257
msgid "Default element styles"
msgstr "Standaardstijlen voor elementen"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:258
msgid "Load the plugin’s own styles for buttons, links and titles. Switch this off when your theme styles them through the classes below. The button colors and border radius under Appearance then only apply to the banner and placeholders."
msgstr "Laad de eigen stijlen van de plugin voor knoppen, links en titels. Zet dit uit als je theme ze opmaakt via de classes hieronder. De knopkleuren en afronding onder Weergave gelden dan alleen nog voor de banner en de placeholders."

