msgstr "Dit script verwijderen"

#: includes/class-fc-admin.php:693
msgid "Paste the snippet here — with or without the surrounding <script> tags."
msgstr "Plak de snippet hier — met of zonder de omringende <script>-tags."

#. translators: 1: required WordPress version, 2: required PHP version.
#: includes/class-fc-plugin.php:80
#, php-format
msgid "FishCakes requires WordPress %1$s or higher and PHP %2$s or higher. The plugin is not active on this site."
msgstr "FishCakes vereist WordPress %1$s of hoger en PHP %2$s of hoger. De plugin is niet actief op deze site."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:166
msgid "Cookies"
msgstr "Cookies"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:167
msgid "We use cookies and similar technologies on this website. Choose which cookies we may place. You can change your choice at any time. See our {privacy_link} for more information."
msgstr "Wij gebruiken cookies en vergelijkbare technieken op deze website. Kies welke cookies we mogen plaatsen. Je kunt je keuze altijd weer aanpassen. Lees ons {privacy_link} voor meer informatie."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:168
msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr "privacybeleid"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:169
msgid "Accept all cookies"
msgstr "Alle cookies accepteren"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:170
msgid "Reject all cookies"
msgstr "Alle cookies weigeren"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:171
msgid "Save choices"
msgstr "Keuzes opslaan"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:172
msgid "Change choices"
msgstr "Keuzes aanpassen"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:173
msgid "Your cookie preferences have been saved."
msgstr "Je cookievoorkeuren zijn opgeslagen."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:174
#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:175
msgid "Cookie settings"
msgstr "Cookie-instellingen"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:176
msgid "You have not made a choice about cookies yet, so we cannot show this content. It may be placed by a third party that could follow you across websites."
msgstr "Je hebt nog geen keuze gemaakt over cookies, daarom kunnen we deze inhoud niet tonen. De inhoud wordt mogelijk geplaatst door een derde partij die je over verschillende websites kan volgen."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:177
msgid "Your cookie preferences do not allow this content, because it may be placed by a third party that could follow you across websites."
msgstr "Je cookievoorkeuren staan deze inhoud niet toe, omdat die mogelijk wordt geplaatst door een derde partij die je over verschillende websites kan volgen."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:178
msgid "Necessary"
msgstr "Noodzakelijk"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:179
msgid "Necessary cookies are needed for this website to work — for example, to remember your cookie choices. These cannot be switched off."
msgstr "Noodzakelijke cookies zijn nodig om deze website te laten werken — bijvoorbeeld om je cookiekeuze te onthouden. Deze kunnen niet worden uitgeschakeld."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:181
msgid "Analytical cookies measure how this website is used — for example which pages are visited and for how long. We use this data to improve the website."
msgstr "Analytische cookies meten hoe deze website wordt gebruikt — bijvoorbeeld welke pagina's worden bezocht en hoe lang. Met deze gegevens verbeteren we de website."

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:182
msgid "Marketing & social media"
msgstr "Marketing & social media"

#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:183
msgid "Marketing and social media cookies are placed by third parties — such as YouTube, Vimeo and Spotify — to show embedded content and to tailor advertisements to your interests."
msgstr "Marketing- en socialmediacookies worden geplaatst door derde partijen — zoals YouTube, Vimeo en Spotify — om ingesloten inhoud te tonen en advertenties af te stemmen op je interesses."

#. translators: Embed provider name.
#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:254
msgid "Google Maps"
msgstr "Google Maps"

#. translators: %d: number of script rows.
#: includes/class-fc-settings.php:559
#, php-format
msgid "FishCakes: %d script was not saved because it was empty or its URL was invalid."
msgid_plural "FishCakes: %d scripts were not saved because they were empty or their URLs were invalid."
msgstr[0] "FishCakes: %d script is niet opgeslagen omdat het leeg was of de URL ongeldig was."
msgstr[1] "FishCakes: %d scripts zijn niet opgeslagen omdat ze leeg waren of de URL ongeldig was."
